  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    DiverDB is an unofficial fan resource for Dave the Diver. The site focuses on data that
    players actually search for: fish farming numbers, recipe economy, staff training, weapon
    progression and boss drops.
  </p>
  <p>
    All game data is compiled from the public Dave the Diver community wiki and checked against
    the in-game Marinca and Bancho's restaurant systems. DiverDB is not affiliated with MINTROCKET.
  </p>
</Base>
